  - m_Id: 7516044992417792
    m_Localized: Narrative. You keep your inventory on death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7519241265975296
    m_Localized: Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7548198130384896
    m_Localized: '- A more relaxed experience focused on exploration, story, and
      combat.

      - Upon death, you will keep your inventory, allowing you to
      progress without severe penalties.

      - Ideal for players who want to discover
      the world without worrying about losing progress.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7548227331129344
    m_Localized: '- A balanced experience focused on survival and risk.

      -
      Death has consequences: you will lose the inventory from your current expedition.

      -
      Explore carefully, manage your resources, and decide when to retreat before
      losing everything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
